      "created_at": "2018-01-30T01:57:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, so I noticed that Oblivaeon deals each non-Scion target 9999 infernal damage on \"Impending Doom.\" &nbsp;Time for a dumb question- could Visionary Twist the Ether to turn that into fire damage as it hits Absolute Zero in a Fixed Point, thus unleashing 9999 cold damage on Oblivaeon and trivializing the encounter? I assume there's an effect to avoid this situation, or a similar one. But my question- is it a Baron Blade-esque built-in wall on Oblivaeon itself or more of an environmental-style effect, but on a Scion? &nbsp;Or perhaps is this the secret way that he heroes ACTUALLY beat Oblivaeon?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:53.773Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
