      "created_at": "2018-01-30T02:41:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, we know OblivAeon itself is invincible in the first phase and you have to just bang on his shield.&nbsp; Then you have to reduce him to 0 HP twice after that.&nbsp; But I don't personally know why this trick wouldn't end one phase instantly.&nbsp; Unless, of course, the 9999 damage attack also destroys the environment....</p>",
